    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.pick\n\n### Question\n\nWhat do people use for `<M-CR>` on Mac?\r\n\r\n```\r\n<CR> / <M-CR> chooses current/marked item(s).\r\n```\r\n\r\nFor some reason all that I tried was conflicting.",
