            "body": "> What do people use for `<M-CR>` on Mac?\r\n\r\nCould you please elaborate on why it is a problem on Mac? This key denotes \"Alt-key or meta-key\" (`:h key-codes`), which for Mac is Option key. So pressing `Option+Enter` should work.",
